<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies &amp; Co analyst C. Van Levy said he raised his rating on Vintage Petroleum Inc to buy from accumulate based on the expectation of excellent returns for shareholders.</p>
<p>-- in a statement, said the company's full cycle cash return on investment in 1996 was 119 percent and its gross profit return on investment was 156 percent.</p>
<p>-- estimates net asset value at $34.89 per share.</p>
<p>-- Vintage shares were off 1/16 at 32-3/4 at midday.</p>
</text>
